/**
 * ============================================================================
 * Cloudflare Worker for SubManager (All-in-One: Web UI & Subscription Engine)
 * Database: Cloudflare D1 (SQLite)
 * Features:
 *   - Embedded Full-Featured Web UI at /admin (and /)
 *   - Embedded User Web Subscription View at /u/:username
 *   - VPN Client Base64 Subscription Engine (/sub/:username, /u/:username, /USR/:username)
 *   - Traffic Usage & Duration Progress Bars proxy (/api/sub-info)
 *   - Complete RESTful APIs for Users, Links, Auth & D1 Database Backup/Restore
 *   - Embedded SVG Favicon (/favicon.ico)
 * ============================================================================
 */

